      "message": "Before this change, the current \"Usage Page\" at the end of each finger was \"Digitizer\" (since the last thing we added was Digitizer/Tip Pressure)\n\nAfter this change, the current \"Usage Page\" at the end of each finger is \"Generic Desktop Ctrls\" (to report X/Y), so we need to make sure we are in Digitizer again when we start a new finger (so that \"Usage (Finger)\" is in the correct page).\n\nIt took me quite a while to figure that one out....",
